      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Because of the fiscal situation of the City, which is being adversely affected by recession and inflation, it is necessary to reduce city expenditures; and,",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.236,
