      "text": "Whereas, All personnel, including those employees who may request extensions of employment beyond mandatory retirement age under Section B3-38.0 of the Administrative Code, and those who are continuing in their positions by reason of extensions heretofore granted, must be considered in making determinations to reduce expenditures;",
